{
  "$comment": [
    "Light color themes: each lists its published editor, syntax and terminal colors (ansi: black, red,",
    "green, yellow, blue, magenta, cyan, white, then the bright ones, or a set in ansi.json), and \"ui\" the UI",
    "colors it publishes. Every other shade is derived (ui/web/src/lib/themes/derive.ts). Names and kinds are in",
    "index.json."
  ],
